      <a href="#muscle-bone">Muscle and Bone Loss</a>
      <a href="#how-much">How Much Protein</a>
      <a href="#leucine">Leucine per Meal</a>
      <a href="#soy">Soy and Isoflavones</a>
      <a href="#calcium-d">Calcium and Vitamin D</a>
      <a href="#choose">How to Choose</a>
      <a href="#routine">A Simple Routine</a>
      <a href="#mistakes">Common Mistakes</a>
      <a href="#faq">FAQ</a>
    </TableOfContents>

    <!-- Content -->
